WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.863 --> 00:00:13.145
a few days, the lazy holidays were turning into a nightmare.

2
00:00:13.786 --> 00:00:18.890
Since the girls were not allowed to do their chores—as part of the experiment —the house soon began

3
00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:20.772
to look and smell like a dumpster.

4
00:00:21.592 --> 00:00:26.476
The only tidy, well-kept part of the home was Mother's bedroom and her spot in the living room

5
00:00:26.516 --> 00:00:28.458
where she had her chair and reading table.

6
00:00:29.699 --> 00:00:35.055
She sat there now, pretending to be interested in a book, but actually observing her girls.

7
00:00:35.676 --> 00:00:41.140
Meg, Mother noticed, looked cross and agitated, traits her eldest daughter normally did not display.

8
00:00:41.721 --> 00:00:47.165
Her hair was carelessly tied up and her clothes had several stains, even a small hole under the

9
00:00:47.225 --> 00:00:53.150
armpit. Jo looked like a volcano ready to erupt as she stomped around, shouting loudly at no one

10
00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:57.673
in particular, "Whoever took my book had better hand it over at once!"

11
00:00:58.554 --> 00:01:04.170
Beth, the mildest and gentlest of the four, could be mistaken for a starved child because she was

12
00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:09.114
spending all her time playing the piano and forgetting a fundamental part of her well-being: eating.

13
00:01:09.915 --> 00:01:15.999
Glancing at Beth's fingers, it was just as Mother suspected: they were swollen, stiff, and raw.

14
00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:20.443
Of the four girls, however, Amy was clearly the messiest.

15
00:01:21.023 --> 00:01:26.267
Her paints and brushes were scattered everywhere, making it a challenge at times to walk without tripping over

16
00:01:26.327 --> 00:01:26.988
her art tools.

17
00:01:27.764 --> 00:01:32.827
Her usually curly bouncy hair was now oily and sticking to her cheeks like uncooked bacon.

18
00:01:33.467 --> 00:01:39.110
Specks of paint decorated her hair as if someone had stood over her and sprinkled it generously onto

19
00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:39.570
her head.

20
00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:44.892
"Thank goodness, tomorrow is the last day of this experiment," Mother said to herself.

21
00:01:47.234 --> 00:01:51.956
The next morning the girls reluctantly went downstairs expecting cold food at the table.

22
00:01:52.584 --> 00:01:57.267
During the week of the experiment, by the time the girls had got up, their breakfast was already

23
00:01:57.307 --> 00:02:02.951
cold. They were grumbling and complaining until Jo, who was leading the pack, stopped, sniffed, and smiled.

24
00:02:02.971 --> 00:02:06.454
"Girls! Can you smell that?"

25
00:02:06.694 --> 00:02:07.174
she asked.

26
00:02:07.194 --> 00:02:10.917
"Mmm smells like sausages!"

27
00:02:11.217 --> 00:02:12.938
said Amy, breathing in deeply.

28
00:02:13.639 --> 00:02:18.402
Like a pack of famished wolves, the girls tore into the dining room, where they were greeted by

29
00:02:18.482 --> 00:02:21.244
Mother, who was just laying out a plate of sausages.

30
00:02:22.172 --> 00:02:23.693
"Good morning, my little daughters.

31
00:02:24.354 --> 00:02:28.397
Since the experiment ends today, I thought we'd celebrate with a late breakfast."

32
00:02:29.518 --> 00:02:34.761
Gratefully, the girls sat down to devour their meal while Mother asked their opinions about the experiment.

33
00:02:34.781 --> 00:02:38.684
"It was fun for one day," Jo said in-between bites.

34
00:02:38.704 --> 00:02:40.586
"But I got so bored!

35
00:02:40.906 --> 00:02:43.648
I actually wanted to clean up my room after a while."

36
00:02:44.268 --> 00:02:48.691
Meg nodded and said, "I had such an ache to pick up a needle and mend some old

37
00:02:48.751 --> 00:02:53.521
clothes." "Well, I didn't realize how messy I was," cried Amy.

38
00:02:54.201 --> 00:02:57.282
"My hair, my clothes I looked frightening!"

39
00:02:57.302 --> 00:03:03.784
"I found that when I played the piano, I forgot about everything else," said Beth, blushing.

40
00:03:04.604 --> 00:03:06.645
"Sometimes I even forgot to eat."

41
00:03:06.665 --> 00:03:11.326
"How lucky that we have you, Mother," said Amy dramatically.

42
00:03:11.346 --> 00:03:14.387
"Without you, we might have died!"

43
00:03:15.207 --> 00:03:21.385
Mother was thoughtful for a moment before replying, "Well, actually I'm taking the day off tomorrow."

44
00:03:21.945 --> 00:03:23.505
The girls stared at her, stunned.

45
00:03:23.525 --> 00:03:25.026
"What do you mean?"

46
00:03:25.326 --> 00:03:25.806
asked Meg.

47
00:03:25.826 --> 00:03:31.608
"Since you girls had one week to do as you please, I think I deserve one day all

48
00:03:31.648 --> 00:03:33.208
to myself," said Mother.

49
00:03:34.248 --> 00:03:40.230
The girls looked at each other, at a loss for words, until Jo finally said, "Of course, Mother

50
00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:41.310
should have the day off.

51
00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:44.291
Don't worry, Mother, we'll manage fine on our own."

52
00:03:44.311 --> 00:03:50.485
"Thank you, darling," said Mother with a smile, then added, "and by the way, Hannah is taking the

53
00:03:50.505 --> 00:03:51.206
day off too."

54
00:03:52.086 --> 00:03:56.609
With that Mother got up and left her daughters contemplating how to deal with the situation.

55
00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.851
That day was a busy one for the March sisters.

56
00:04:01.651 --> 00:04:07.214
After they happily and eagerly performed their chores, they discussed how to divide Mother and Hannah's workload between

57
00:04:07.234 --> 00:04:11.817
them. "Since Jo and I get up early, we'll make breakfast," said Meg.

58
00:04:11.837 --> 00:04:17.060
"I can go to the grocer's to buy our fruit and vegetables," offered Beth.

59
00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:20.923
"I'll do the wash and hang it outside to dry," said Amy.

60
00:04:20.943 --> 00:04:23.105
"What else does Mother do?"

61
00:04:23.385 --> 00:04:25.487
Jo asked, tapping the pencil on her lips.

62
00:04:25.507 --> 00:04:27.949
"Who's going to make lunch and dinner?"

63
00:04:28.349 --> 00:04:28.930
Amy asked.

64
00:04:29.691 --> 00:04:34.074
"Amy and I can make lunch if Jo and Beth take care of dinner," suggested Meg.

65
00:04:34.735 --> 00:04:40.540
With everyone happy, Jo sat back with her hands folded behind her head and said in a relaxed,

66
00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:44.483
confident way, "Mother has nothing to worry about."

67
00:04:46.684 --> 00:04:51.125
It was strange not to see Mother or Hannah in the kitchen the next morning, but Meg and

68
00:04:51.165 --> 00:04:53.206
Jo quickly got busy making breakfast.

69
00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:59.048
They decided on ham and eggs with fresh bread, since Mother always baked her breads early in the

70
00:04:59.088 --> 00:05:00.828
morning. "Jo!"

71
00:05:01.188 --> 00:05:05.530
Meg cried, looking around, "we forgot to set the dough out last night for the bread!"

72
00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:11.171
The girls had often watched Mother kneading the dough and setting it out to rise the night before

73
00:05:11.571 --> 00:05:13.632
so that she could bake it first thing in the morning.

74
00:05:14.648 --> 00:05:20.530
Enjoying a slice of warm fresh bread might not seem like much, but it brought great pleasure and

75
00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.451
comfort to the girls at the start of the day.

76
00:05:23.491 --> 00:05:27.492
Today, sadly, they would have to do without that morning ritual.

77
00:05:27.512 --> 00:05:29.413
"Where are the eggs?"

78
00:05:29.733 --> 00:05:31.874
Jo asked, looking in the baskets and the pantry.

79
00:05:31.894 --> 00:05:34.114
"Something's burning on the stove!"

80
00:05:34.434 --> 00:05:36.555
Meg pointed to the smoke coming from a pan.

81
00:05:36.575 --> 00:05:38.095
"Oh, the ham!"

82
00:05:38.436 --> 00:05:39.980
exclaimed Jo.

83
00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.843
Forgetting how hot the pan was, she grabbed the scorching handle then dropped the pan and its contents

84
00:05:44.863 --> 00:05:47.624
(four thick pieces of burnt ham) onto the floor.

85
00:05:48.905 --> 00:05:51.567
The girls ended up having fruit and milk for breakfast.

86
00:05:53.948 --> 00:05:59.571
Just before setting out for the grocer's, Beth realized she didn't know what to buy, so she went

87
00:05:59.611 --> 00:06:01.572
to Mother, who was sitting in her chair reading.

88
00:06:01.592 --> 00:06:08.236
"Darling," Mother interrupted, holding up her hand when Beth started speaking, "today is my day off.

89
00:06:08.512 --> 00:06:10.233
You must figure it out on your own."

90
00:06:10.893 --> 00:06:15.554
A little while later, Amy also approached Mother for advice on what she should wash first.

91
00:06:16.234 --> 00:06:19.475
Mother simply repeated what she had told Beth and returned to her book.

92
00:06:21.676 --> 00:06:24.976
The girls did not realize how dependent they were on Mother and Hannah.

93
00:06:25.857 --> 00:06:31.398
Sitting together for their dinner—a simple meal of meatloaf and bread—the girls talked about their day.

94
00:06:31.418 --> 00:06:37.560
"I didn't realize how much Mother and Hannah did for us," said Meg, resting her weary head on

95
00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:38.060
her hands.

96
00:06:39.156 --> 00:06:43.119
"My hands are still hurting from doing the laundry," complained Amy.

97
00:06:43.139 --> 00:06:46.981
"It was so hard to choose what to buy," said Beth.

98
00:06:47.001 --> 00:06:51.524
"I wonder if Mother plans to take days off regularly," said Amy.

99
00:06:51.544 --> 00:06:55.367
"I think Mother wanted to teach us a lesson," said Jo.

100
00:06:56.168 --> 00:06:57.168
Nodding, Meg agreed.

101
00:06:57.188 --> 00:07:00.250
"Our experiment taught us to appreciate work."

102
00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:05.674
"And Mother wanted us to see the importance of taking care of ourselves," added Jo.

103
00:07:05.694 --> 00:07:08.536
"And of helping each other," said Beth.

104
00:07:09.152 --> 00:07:14.456
"And supporting each other," said Meg as she tried to swallow a bite of dry salty meatloaf.

105
00:07:14.476 --> 00:07:18.860
"And loving each other," smiled Amy, pushing her plate away.
